ation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The statement is true: *The Nutcracker Suite* by Tchaikovsky was indeed part of Disney's *Fantasia* (1940).  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 101, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 134}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Cartoon & Animations_2826", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In \"Avatar: The Last Airbender\", which element does Aang begin to learn after being defrosted?\n\nOptions: \nA. Earth\nB. Water\nC. Fire\nD. Air\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Aang begins learning waterbending first after being freed from the iceberg, following the traditional Avatar cycle order (water, earth, fire).  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 107, "output_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 145}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Cartoon & Animations_675", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What town was \"Springfield\" from \"The Simpsons\" originally named after?\n\nOptions: \nA. Springfield, Illinois\nB. Springfield, Oregon\nC. Springfield, Missouri\nD. Springfield, Massachusetts\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "T