: {"input_tokens": 109, "output_tokens": 65, "total_tokens": 174}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_2958", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In \"Homestuck\" the \"Kingdom of Darkness\" is also known as?\n\nOptions: \nA. Derse\nB. Prospit\nC. Skaia\nD. The Medium\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In *Homestuck*, the \"Kingdom of Darkness\" is the dream moon associated with the Derse dreamers. The counterpart is Prospit, the \"Kingdom of Light.\" Therefore, the correct answer is Derse.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 149}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_324", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Bionicle, who was formerly a Av-Matoran and is now the Toa of Light?\n\nOptions: \nA. Vakama\nB. Takua\nC. Tahu\nD. Jaller\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Takua was the Av-Matoran who became the Toa of Light, known as Takanuva.  \nThe other options are either Toa of other elements or not Toa of Light.  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 102, "output_tokens": 39, "total_tokens": 141}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Com