d on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Who authored The Adventures of Tintin?\n\nOptions: \nA. E.P. Jacobs\nB. Herg\u00e9\nC. Rin Tin Tin\nD. Chic Young\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Adventures of Tintin was created by the Belgian cartoonist Herg\u00e9.  \nThe other options are incorrect: E.P. Jacobs created Blake and Mortimer, Rin Tin Tin was a fictional dog from film/TV, and Chic Young created Blondie.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 98, "output_tokens": 61, "total_tokens": 159}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_2252", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What's the weakness of american vampires (Scott Snyder's American Vampire)?\n\nOptions: \nA. Sunlight\nB. Gold\nC. Silver\nD. Wood\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In Scott Snyder's *American Vampire*, the American vampires are a new breed with different weaknesses; specifically, they are vulnerable to gold, not sunlight or traditional vampire weaknesses. This is a key distinction from other vampire lore in the series.  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 55, "total_tokens": 155}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_2540", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Who created Ultron of Earth-616?\n\nOptions: \nA. Henry Pym\nB. Tony Stark\nC. Reed Richards\nD. Amadeus Cho\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In the Earth-616 Marvel Universe, Ultron was created by Henry Pym (Ant-Man), not the other characters listed. This is a well-established fact in mainstream Marvel comics continuity. Therefore, the correct choice is A.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 52, "total_tokens": 152}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_2125", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In the Homestuck Series, what is the alternate name for the Kingdom of Lights?\n\nOptions: \nA. No Name\nB. Yellow Moon\nC. Prospit\nD. Golden City\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In Homestuck, the Kingdom of Lights is the alternate name for Prospit, the moon associated with the Prospitian dreamers and the planet of the Wastes.  \nThe correct answer is **C**.  \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 107, "output_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 155}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_2999", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What otherworldly land does Thor come from?\n\nOptions: \nA. Asgard\nB. Sovengarde\nC. Midgard\nD. Jotunheim\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Thor is a Marvel superhero based on Norse mythology, and his home is the realm of the gods. In both the comics and the films, this realm is named Asgard. Therefore, the correct answer is A.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 98, "output_tokens": 50, "total_tokens": 148}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_1300", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The \"Pepe\" meme originated from a comic drawn by Matt Furie called \"Boy's Club\"?\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The \"Pepe\" meme character first appeared in Matt Furie's comic \"Boy's Club,\" making the statement accurate.  \n**Answer:** \\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 99, "output_tokens": 32, "total_tokens": 131}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_3858", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Black Hammer, what dimension does Colonel Weird travel through?\n\nOptions: \nA. Phantom Zone\nB. Mirror Universe\nC. Hyperspace\nD. Para-Zone\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 s