. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The New Republic is the government established after the Galactic Empire's fall, as depicted in the sequel trilogy and expanded material. The Rebel Alliance preceded it, the Crimson Dawn is a criminal syndicate, and the First Order arose later as a remnant faction.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 120, "output_tokens": 69, "total_tokens": 189}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Film_1502", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The color of the pills in the Matrix were Blue and Yellow.\n\nOptions: \nA. True\nB. False\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The pills in *The Matrix* were red and blue, not blue and yellow.  \nTherefore, the statement is false.  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 94, "output_tokens": 28, "total_tokens": 122}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Film_2098", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What was the wifi password given to Stephen Strange in Doctor Strange?\n\nOptions: \nA. Chakra\nB. Ancient\nC. Shambala\nD. Peace\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In *Doctor Strange*, the Wi-Fi pa