tokens": 151}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_853", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Night In The Woods, where does Gregg work?\n\nOptions: \nA. Ol' Pickaxe\nB. Food Donkey\nC. Video Outpost \"Too\"\nD. Snack Falcon\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Gregg works at Snack Falcon in *Night in the Woods*.  \n\n**Correct Answer:** \\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 24, "total_tokens": 124}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_2108", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In vanilla Minecraft, which of the following cannot be made into a block?\n\nOptions: \nA. Wheat\nB. Charcoal\nC. Coal\nD. String\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In vanilla Minecraft, wheat, charcoal, and coal can all be crafted into blocks (hay bale, charcoal block, and coal block), but string cannot be crafted into a block. String can be crafted into wool, but wool itself is not a \"string block\" in the same sense. Therefore, string is the item that cannot be made into a block.\n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 79, "total_tokens": 179}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_5", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In the Half-Life universe, the Black Mesa Research Facility is located in which US state?\n\nOptions: \nA. New Mexico\nB. Nevada\nC. Arizona\nD. Wyoming\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In the *Half-Life* series, Black Mesa is explicitly situated in New Mexico, as referenced in the games' lore and supporting materials.  \nThe other states are not the canonical location.  \n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 109, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 158}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_330", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In \"Minecraft\", gold tools are faster than diamond tools.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Gold tools have a higher mining speed for certain blocks, but they have lower durability and overall efficiency compared to diamond tools, making the statement false.  \n**Answer:** \\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 83, "output_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 121}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_3715", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In the \"Ace Attorney\" series, what is the relationship between Apollo Justice and Trucy Wright?\n\nOptions: \nA. They're co-workers\nB. They're friends\nC. They're half-siblings\nD. They're both attorneys\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In the *Ace Attorney* series, it is later revealed that Apollo Justice and Trucy Wright share the same biological father, making them half-siblings. This is a key plot point in the later games.  \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 111, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 160}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_2238", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which one of these nations was added to Civilization V with the \"Gods & Kings\" expansion?\n\nOptions: \nA. The Ottomans\nB. The Zulu\nC. The Kongo\nD. The Netherlands\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The correct answer is **D. The Netherlands**, as they were introduced in the *Gods & Kings* expansion for *Civilization V*. The Ottomans and Zulu were added in other expansions, while the Kongo was not in *Civilization V* at all.\n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 111, "output_tokens": 62, "total_tokens": 173}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_1029", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the fastest speed possible in Trackmania\u00b2: Stadium?\n\nOptions: \nA. 320 km/h\nB. 100 km/h\nC. 500 km/h\nD. 1000  km/h\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The fastest possible speed in Trackmania\u00b2: Stadium is 1000 km/h, which is a known engine limit in the game.  \nThis speed is achievable under specific conditions like using speed boosts and downhill sections.  \n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 111, "output_tokens": 50, "total_tokens": 161}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_216", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Splatoon, what is the age that inklings can freely change between squid and humanoid forms?\n\nOptions: \nA. 10\nB. 13\nC. 16\nD. 14\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In the *Splatoon* lore, Inklings gain the ability to transform between squid and humanoid forms at age 14. This is established in the game\u2019s official backstory and promotional material.  \n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 104, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 153}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_2820", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Each piece in Tetris is called a tetris.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The statement is incorrect because in Tetris, the pieces are called \"tetrominoes,\" not \"tetris.\"  \nTherefore, the correct answer is **False**.  \n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 89, "output_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 127}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_3601", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In \"Team Fortress 2\", how much health does a scout have when overhealed?\n\nOptions: \nA. 195\nB. 225\nC. 215\nD. 185\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "In *Team Fortress 2*, the Scout\u2019s base health is 125. Overheal provides up to 50% extra health, so 125 \u00d7 1.5 = 187.5, which rounds to 185.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 101, "output_tokens": 60, "total_tokens": 161}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_62", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What ingredient is NOT used to craft a cake in Minecraft?\n\nOptions: \nA. Wheat\nB. Bread\nC. Milk\nD. Egg\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. K