ed by Gabe Newell and Mike Harrington on **August 24, 1996**, in Kirkland, Washington.\n\nCorrect answer: \\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 109, "output_tokens": 37, "total_tokens": 146}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_1150", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Gordon Freeman is said to have burnt and destroyed what food in the break room microwave?\n\nOptions: \nA. Sub Sandwich\nB. Casserole\nC. Chicken Soup\nD. Pepperoni Pizza\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The correct answer is **D. Pepperoni Pizza**, as referenced in the game *Half-Life 2: Episode Two* where a microwave in the break room contains a burnt pizza with Gordon Freeman\u2019s name on it.  \n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 106, "output_tokens": 52, "total_tokens": 158}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Video Games_1875", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Who is the victim mentioned in the second KG-8 incident, in Ace attorney Investigations, Case 4?\n\nOptions: \nA. Frank Sahwit\nB. Shey De Killer\nC. Deid Mann\nD. Raymond Shields\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The victim in the second KG-8 incident (the one involving the smuggling ring) is Deid Mann.  \nTh