ased on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Formula 1, the Virtual Safety Car was introduced following the fatal crash of which driver?\n\nOptions: \nA. Gilles Villeneuve\nB. Ronald Ratzenberger\nC. Jules Bianchi\nD. Ayrton Senna\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Virtual Safety Car was introduced after Jules Bianchi\u2019s fatal crash at the 2014 Japanese Grand Prix.  \nThis led to changes in safety procedures to prevent similar incidents under yellow flag conditions.  \n\n**Correct answer:** \\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 118, "output_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 177}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Sports_1550", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Soccer player Cristiano Ronaldo opened a museum dedicated to himself.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Cristiano Ronaldo did open a museum dedicated to his career achievements, called the Museu CR7, in Funchal, Madeira. This is a well-documented fact. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 96, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 136}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Sports_2249", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Peyton Manning retired after winning Super Bowl XLIX.\n\nO