, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_1785", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the make and model of the tour vehicles in \"Jurassic Park\" (1990)?\n\nOptions: \nA. 1989 Toyota Land Cruiser\nB. Mercedes M-Class\nC. 1989 Ford Explorer XLT\nD. 1989 Jeep Wrangler YJ Sahar\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The tour vehicles in the 1990 film *Jurassic Park* are Ford Explorers, specifically modified 1989 models with the \"Explorer XLT\" decals removed for the film but still identifiable as that model.  \nThe correct choice from the list is the 1989 Ford Explorer XLT.  \nThe other vehicles, like the Toyota Land Cruiser, were used in later sequels.\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 122, "output_tokens": 88, "total_tokens": 210}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_1788", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The Harry Potter series of books, combined, are over 1,000,000 words in length.\n\nOptions: \nA. True\nB. False\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Harry Potter series is over a million words in length\u2014estimates typically place it around 1,084,000 words. Therefore, the statement is true.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 99,