ter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Mary Ann Evans wrote under the pen name **George Eliot** to have her work taken seriously in the Victorian era, when female authors often faced prejudice.  \nThe correct answer is D.\n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 95, "output_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 138}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_2561", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In the novel 1984, written by George Orwell, what is the name of the totalitarian regime that controls Oceania?\n\nOptions: \nA. Neo-Bolshevism\nB. Obliteration of the Self\nC. Earth Alliance\nD. INGSOC\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The correct answer is D, as INGSOC (English Socialism) is the name of the ruling ideology and regime in *1984*.  \n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 116, "output_tokens": 35, "total_tokens": 151}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_2586", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the name of Sherlock Holmes's brother?\n\nOptions: \nA. Mederi Holmes\nB. Martin Holmes\nC. Herbie Hancock Holmes\nD. Mycroft Holmes\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_resu