 to India}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 73, "output_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 111}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Literature_1482", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A poet from this country concluded a poem, \"I am light honed to a still point in the incandescent onrush, a  ne ash in the beast's sudden desiccation when the sun explodes.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The poet is from **Chile**, and the lines are from Pablo Neruda\u2019s poem \u201cThe Egoist.\u201d  \n\n\\boxed{Chile}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 133}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Literature_169", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This novel enjoins the reader to consult a \"metaphysical professor\" should they \"ever be athirst in the great American desert,\" since \"as everyone knows, meditation and water are wedded forever.\"\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The quote is from Herman Melville\u2019s *Moby-Dick*, in the chapter titled \u201cThe Lee Shore.\u201d  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{Moby-Dick}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 112, "output_tokens": 30, "total_tokens": 142}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Literature_180", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: An essay by Rebecca West argues that people cannot be dissuaded from this practice when it seems to their advantage unless they have been brought up with \"common worship\" and \"folk songs.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The essay by Rebecca West is referring to the practice of **lying**.  \n\n\\boxed{lying}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 110, "output_tokens": 21, "total_tokens": 131}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Literature_197", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Epistemology of the Closet, Eve Sedgwick writes that this novel anticipates the discourse surrounding the AIDS epidemic by presenting a fantasy of life \"after the homosexual.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Eve Sedgwick identifies *The Picture of Dorian Gray* by Oscar Wilde as the novel that anticipates the discourse surrounding the AIDS epidemic.  \n\n\\boxed{The Picture of Dorian Gray}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 90, "output_tokens": 41, "total_tokens": 131}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_Literature_217", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This author's attempts to efface the \"realistic sources\" of his works represent an \"intent of undoing,\" according to Stanley Gontarski.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{