: "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The largest city in China by population is Shanghai.  \nIt is a major global financial center and the most populous urban area in the country.  \n\n\\boxed{Shanghai}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 72, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 112}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoGraphyData_100k_13", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the capital of Canada?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The capital of Canada is Ottawa.\n\n\\boxed{Ottawa}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 71, "output_tokens": 12, "total_tokens": 83}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoGraphyData_100k_14", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which mountain range separates Europe and Asia?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Ural Mountains are the primary mountain range that forms the traditional boundary between Europe and Asia.\n\n\\boxed{Ural Mountains}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 75, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 108}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "GeoGraphyData_100k_15", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is the capital of Japan?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, wh