e. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Great Sphinx of Giza has the body of a lion, which symbolizes strength and guardianship in ancient Egyptian culture.  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 97, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 130}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_2604", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In which English county is the city of Portsmouth?\n\nOptions: \nA. Hampshire\nB. Buckinghamshire\nC. Surrey\nD. Oxfordshire\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Portsmouth is located in Hampshire, which is a historic county on the south coast of England.  \n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 102, "output_tokens": 26, "total_tokens": 128}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_3843", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Colchester Overpass, otherwise known as \"Bunny Man Bridge\", is located where?\n\nOptions: \nA. Fairfax County, Virginia\nB. Lemon Grove, California\nC. Braxton County, Virgina\nD. Medford, Oregon\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Colchester Overpass, often called \"Bunny Man Bridge,\" is a well-known urban legend site located in Fairfax County, Virginia.  \nThe correct answer is **A**.  \n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 119, "output_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 162}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_3353", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: There are no roads in/out of Juneau, Alaska.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Juneau is the only U.S. state capital not accessible by road; it is reachable only by air or sea.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 90, "output_tokens": 30, "total_tokens": 120}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_1545", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: St. Louis is the capital of the US State Missouri.\n\nOptions: \nA. True\nB. False\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "**B. False**  \nThe capital of Missouri is Jefferson City, not St. Louis. St. Louis is a major city in the state but has never been the capital.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 82, "output_tokens": 41, "total_tokens": 123}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_4025", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Where would you find the \"Spanish Steps\"?\n\nOptions: \nA. London, England\nB. Barcelona, Spain\nC. Rome, Italy\nD. Berlin, Germany\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Spanish Steps are a famous landmark located in Rome, Italy. They are not in Spain, despite the name.  \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 103, "output_tokens": 29, "total_tokens": 132}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_429", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What North American tourist attraction is served by the \"Maid of the Mist\" tour company?\n\nOptions: \nA. Yosemite National Park\nB. Niagara Falls\nC. Disney World\nD. Whistler, British Columbia\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The \"Maid of the Mist\" tour company is famous for its boat tours that take visitors close to the base of Niagara Falls.  \nTherefore, the correct answer is Niagara Falls.  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 119, "output_tokens": 45, "total_tokens": 164}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_3559", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The Space Needle is located in which city?\n\nOptions: \nA. Los Angles\nB. Vancouver\nC. Toronto\nD.