", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: You could walk from Norway to North Korea while only passing through Russia.\n\nOptions: \nA. False\nB. True\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "This is true because Norway and Russia share a land border, and Russia also shares a land border with North Korea along the Tumen River. Therefore, it is possible to walk from Norway to North Korea while only passing through Russia.  \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 90, "output_tokens": 53, "total_tokens": 143}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_870", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following countries banned the use of personal genetic ancestry tests?\n\nOptions: \nA. Austria\nB. Germany\nC. Canada\nD. Sweden\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Germany has banned direct-to-consumer genetic ancestry tests without medical supervision, as they are considered medical devices requiring regulatory approval. The other listed countries do not have nationwide bans on such tests. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 106, "output_tokens": 60, "total_tokens": 166}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Geography_3207", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions an