uestion and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A preacher from this city's New Bethel Baptist Church became known as The Man with the Million Dollar Voice a ter recording and selling his sermons, such as \"The Eagle Stirreth Her Nest.\"\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The preacher known as \"The Man with the Million Dollar Voice\" from New Bethel Baptist Church was Reverend C. L. Franklin, who was based in Detroit.  \n\n\\boxed{Detroit}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 110, "output_tokens": 41, "total_tokens": 151}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_638", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Most of the companies owned by Errett Lobban Cord were in this industry.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Errett Lobban Cord was a prominent industrialist known for his holdings in the automotive and transportation sectors, particularly through the Cord Corporation, which included companies like Auburn Automobile and Lycoming Engines. Therefore, the industry most associated with his companies is **automotive**.  \n\n\\boxed{automotive}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 81, "output_tokens": 82, "total_tokens": 163}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_262", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This country was dominated for more than a century by the True Whig Party, which once infamously \"won\" an election with fifteen times more votes than eligible voters.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The country is Liberia, where the True Whig Party held power from 1878 until the 1980 coup.  \n\n\\boxed{Liberia}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 105, "output_tokens": 27, "total_tokens": 132}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_1084", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: AT&amp;T executive Frederick Kappel reformed this organization after its public failure in Chicago during Christmas in 1966.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The organization that failed publicly in Chicago during Christmas 1966 was the United States Postal Service, which was then called the Post Office Department. AT&T executive Frederick Kappel led a commission that recommended reforms leading to its reorganization into the U.S. Postal Service.  \n\n\\boxed{United States Postal Service}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 86, "output_tokens": 64, "total_tokens": 150}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_1090", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: While running for President, a man in this position released an unprecedented 12 years of his tax returns.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The man who released 12 years of tax returns while running for president was Mitt Romney in 2012.  \nThis was an unprecedented level of financial disclosure for a presidential candidate at the time.  \n\n\\boxed{Mitt Romney}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 76, "output_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 124}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_230", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This leader let filmmaker Barbet Schroeder record his cabinet's daily proceedings for a documentary subtitled \"A Self Portrait.\"\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The leader who allowed Barbet Schroeder to film his cabinet for the documentary *The Venerable W.* (subtitled \"A Self Portrait\") was **Pol Pot**.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{Pol Pot}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 85, "output_tokens": 47, "total_tokens": 132}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_622", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A presidential candidate in this year did a series of advertisements featuring him informally talking to former baseball player Joe Garagiola.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The advertisements described were for George H. W. Bush during t