wer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The Washington Post claimed that Barack Obama's head of this agency considered resigning because \"there are days where I have literally nothing to do.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Washington Post article described the head of the **National Endowment for the Humanities** considering resignation due to lack of work during the Obama administration.\n\n\\boxed{National Endowment for the Humanities}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 83, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 123}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_44", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Ken Light sued Richard Taylor over his performance of this action, which led voters to associate John Kerry with Jane Fonda during the 2004 presidential election.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The lawsuit was over the creation and distribution of a \"swift boat\" ad that falsely depicted John Kerry and Jane Fonda together at an antiwar rally.\n\n\\boxed{Swift Boat Ad}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 86, "output_tokens": 41, "total_tokens": 127}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_1019", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Homeowners in this city were granted a special bread ration called the  panes aedium .\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is th