ad the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: An archbishop of this city who presided over and was responsible for implementing the Council of Trent was named Charles Borromeo.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The archbishop was Charles Borromeo, and the city he served was Milan.\n\n\\boxed{Milan}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 96, "output_tokens": 21, "total_tokens": 117}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_106", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In a scene first shown in this publication, a man states \"Oh no, my Lord, I assure you that parts of it are excellent!\"\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The quote is from Jane Austen's *Pride and Prejudice*, spoken by Mr. Collins about the sermon he is reading to the Bennet family. The scene first appears in the novel when it was originally published.  \n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{Pride and Prejudice}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 90, "output_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 149}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_1109", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This man founded a whiskey distillery named after a local strain of moonshine, Valley Tan.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The man who founded a whiskey distillery named after the local moonshine \"Valley Tan\" was **Brigham Young**.  \nHe established the distillery in the Utah Territory during the 19th century.  \n\\boxed{Brigham Young}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 75, "output_tokens": 53, "total_tokens": 128}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_1230", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: One form of this resource was governed by the precarium, a type of law derived from the word preces meaning \"request.\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The resource is **land**.\n\n\\boxed{land}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 81, "output_tokens": 12, "total_tokens": 93}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "for_optimality": false}, {"global index": "QANTA_History_593", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: A recent book about this man's \"Black Jesus\" notes the brief but powerful influence of Adam Clayton Powell Sr\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.2", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The question refers to a book about \u201cBlack Jesus,\u201d which is a nickname for **Martin Luther King Jr.**  \n\n\\boxed{Martin Luther King Jr.}", "success": true, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 78, "output_tokens": 33, "total_tokens": 111}}, "cost": null, "accuracy": null, "fo